# Cook's Pride (jeuno 16): the Super Soup Pot held while the quest is available (GM; The Wonder Magic Set accepted, so
# the offer is not met), then again once completed: Naruru's 187 plays in any status (the pot arm reads none) and its
# finish completes the quest each time. Quest[3][16]Prog 1 (GM) kept (the raw player:completeQuest).
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-53.2,-0.1,-139.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.TheWonderMagicSet accepted
keyitem SuperSoupPot
login
charvar Quest[3][16]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trigger Naruru                          # available (not offered), the pot held: 187
finish                                  # completed from available; the ring, the gil; the pot taken
keyitem SuperSoupPot                    # GM: the pot again
trigger Naruru                          # completed, the pot held: 187
finish                                  # a second ring, 3000 gil, title, fame; completeQuest again
